WEBVTT

00:10:58.940 --> 00:11:00.261
and the higher up you go,

00:11:00.285 --> 00:11:02.818
the more obvious it is
that you're not there anymore.

00:11:02.842 --> 00:11:03.993
That's what I call

00:11:04.017 --> 00:11:06.824
the Law of Psychoprofessional Gravitation.

00:11:06.848 --> 00:11:09.943
You notice a lot when you were great

00:11:09.967 --> 00:11:12.419
and you're not as great as you once were.

00:11:12.443 --> 00:11:13.903
And if you can do something

00:11:13.927 --> 00:11:16.141
to get on your crystallized
intelligence curve,

00:11:16.165 --> 00:11:18.141
you get a different kind of productivity,

00:11:18.165 --> 00:11:20.288
and you can be successful
in a different way.

00:11:20.312 --> 00:11:22.352
That's the knowledge I want to get across.

00:11:22.376 --> 00:11:25.090
AG: He's arguing that regardless
of what field you're in,

00:11:25.114 --> 00:11:28.034
as your fluid intelligence declines,
you should make a change.

00:11:28.058 --> 00:11:29.242
Stop trying to innovate.

00:11:29.266 --> 00:11:31.282
Take what you've learned and accomplished